            <h2><span class="lang-en">Also — matmul rank validation</span><span class="lang-kr">추가 — matmul rank 검증</span></h2>
            <p class="lang-en">
              Rank-1 <code>matmul</code> calls previously bypassed <code>TensorCheck</code> (a <code>D &lt; 2</code>
              short-circuit) and failed inconsistently per backend: ndarray panicked with
              <code>attempt to subtract with overflow</code> (<code>shape_lhs[ndims - 2]</code> underflows at
              <code>ndims == 1</code>), tch treated 1D×1D as a dot product and returned a 0-dim scalar inconsistent
              with the <code>Tensor&lt;1&gt;</code> output rank, and cubecl had no valid kernel input.
              Merged as <a href="https://github.com/tracel-ai/burn/pull/5580" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #5580</a>.
            </p>
            <p class="lang-kr">
              rank-1 <code>matmul</code> 호출이 기존에 <code>TensorCheck</code>를 (<code>D &lt; 2</code>
              short-circuit으로) 우회해 백엔드마다 제각각 실패했습니다: ndarray는 <code>attempt to subtract with overflow</code>
              (<code>ndims == 1</code>에서 <code>shape_lhs[ndims - 2]</code> 언더플로), tch는 1D×1D를 dot product로
              처리해 <code>Tensor&lt;1&gt;</code> 출력 rank와 모순되는 0차원 스칼라 반환, cubecl은 유효한 커널 입력 없음.
              <a href="https://github.com/tracel-ai/burn/pull/5580" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #5580</a>로 머지됐습니다.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li class="lang-en"><code>TensorCheck::matmul</code> now registers a clear error for ranks &lt; 2, mirroring the <code>tri()</code> check.</li>
              <li class="lang-kr"><code>TensorCheck::matmul</code>이 <code>tri()</code> 검증처럼 rank &lt; 2에 명확한 에러를 등록합니다.</li>
              <li class="lang-en">Regression test <code>float_should_panic_when_rank_is_less_than_2</code> in <code>burn-backend-tests/tests/tensor/float/ops/matmul.rs</code> — verified to fail with the backend overflow panic (not the expected message) when the check is removed.</li>
              <li class="lang-kr"><code>burn-backend-tests/tests/tensor/float/ops/matmul.rs</code>에 회귀 테스트 <code>float_should_panic_when_rank_is_less_than_2</code> 추가 — 검증 제거 시 기대 메시지가 아닌 백엔드 overflow panic으로 실패함을 확인했습니다.</li>
              <li class="lang-en">Merged directly by the maintainer.</li>
              <li class="lang-kr">메인테이너가 직접 머지했습니다.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-2">
              <a href="https://github.com/tracel-ai/burn/pull/5580" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">PR #5580 ↗</a>
            </div>

            <h2><span class="lang-en">Also — no-std vec! macro fix</span><span class="lang-kr">추가 — no-std vec! 매크로 수정</span></h2>
            <p class="lang-en">
              The no-std test job failed to compile <code>burn-std</code>: <code>layout.rs</code> (added in #5625)
              imports <code>use alloc::vec::Vec;</code> but never the <code>vec!</code> macro, and its
              <code>#[cfg(test)]</code> module uses <code>vec![...]</code> — which only compiles with the std
              prelude available. Added <code>use alloc::vec;</code>. Merged as
              <a href="https://github.com/tracel-ai/burn/pull/5639" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #5639</a>.
            </p>
            <p class="lang-kr">
              no-std 테스트 잡이 <code>burn-std</code>를 컴파일하지 못했습니다: <code>layout.rs</code>(#5625에서 추가)는
              <code>use alloc::vec::Vec;</code>만 임포트하고 <code>vec!</code> 매크로는 임포트하지 않았는데, 그
              <code>#[cfg(test)]</code> 모듈이 <code>vec![...]</code>를 사용합니다 — std 프렐류드가 있을 때만 컴파일됩니다.
              <code>use alloc::vec;</code>를 추가했습니다.
              <a href="https://github.com/tracel-ai/burn/pull/5639" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #5639</a>로 머지됐습니다.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li class="lang-en">Reproduced locally: <code>cargo test --no-default-features --release -p burn-std</code> produced 4 <code>cannot find macro vec</code> errors; after the fix, 168 unit tests pass.</li>
              <li class="lang-kr">로컬 재현: <code>cargo test --no-default-features --release -p burn-std</code>가 <code>cannot find macro vec</code> 오류 4건을 냈고, 수정 후 168개 유닛 테스트가 통과합니다.</li>
              <li class="lang-en">Merged directly by the maintainer.</li>
              <li class="lang-kr">메인테이너가 직접 머지했습니다.</li>
            </ul>

