              <span class="chip">Rust</span>
            </div>

            <h2><span class="lang-en">What</span><span class="lang-kr">무엇</span></h2>
            <p class="lang-en">
              Replaced the <code>BufferBuilder</code> used to re-encode sliced IPC run-ends with
              <code>Vec</code> in <code>into_zero_offset_run_array</code> (arrow-ipc writer).
              This was the one callsite still using the builder on current main — the other candidates in
              <a href="https://github.com/apache/arrow-rs/issues/10245" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#10245</a>'s
              list had already been converted, so I located the real remaining path rather than re-doing a converted one.
              Merged as <a href="https://github.com/apache/arrow-rs/pull/11005" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #11005</a>.
            </p>
            <p class="lang-kr">
              IPC run-ends 재인코딩(<code>into_zero_offset_run_array</code>, arrow-ipc writer)에 쓰던
              <code>BufferBuilder</code>를 <code>Vec</code>으로 교체했습니다. 유지보수자들이
              "Rust의 최적화된 <code>Vec</code>이 빌더 추상화보다 우세하다"고 관찰한
              <a href="https://github.com/apache/arrow-rs/issues/10245" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#10245</a>의
              전환 작업 중 main에 실제로 남은 마지막 callsite였습니다 (목록의 다른 후보들은 이미 변환돼 있어서, 변환된 곳을
              다시 고치는 대신 진짜 남은 경로를 찾아 작업했습니다).
              <a href="https://github.com/apache/arrow-rs/pull/11005" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #11005</a>로 머지됐습니다.
            </p>

            <h2><span class="lang-en">How</span><span class="lang-kr">과정</span></h2>
            <ul>
              <li class="lang-en">No behavior change: the re-encoded run-ends buffer is byte-identical.</li>
              <li class="lang-kr">행동 변화 없음: 재인코딩된 run-ends 버퍼는 바이트 단위로 동일합니다.</li>
              <li class="lang-en">Verified with the full <code>arrow-ipc</code> suite — the run-array roundtrip tests exercise the re-encoding path for every slice length and both slice offsets.</li>
              <li class="lang-kr"><code>arrow-ipc</code> 전체 테스트로 검증 — run-array 라운드트립 테스트가 모든 슬라이스 길이와 양쪽 slice offset에 대해 재인코딩 경로를 검사합니다.</li>
              <li class="lang-en">Approved by two maintainers and merged.</li>
              <li class="lang-kr">메인테이너 2명의 승인 후 머지됐습니다.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-2">
              <a href="https://github.com/apache/arrow-rs/pull/11005" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">PR #11005 ↗</a>
            </div>

            <h2><span class="lang-en">Also — interval parsing follow-up</span><span class="lang-kr">추가 — interval 파싱 후속</span></h2>
            <p class="lang-en">
              A follow-up (<a href="https://github.com/apache/arrow-rs/pull/11006" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #11006</a>,
              under review) relaxes interval parsing so bare units like <code>"5 day hour"</code> parse as
              <code>"5 day 0 hour"</code>, matching PostgreSQL.
            </p>
            <p class="lang-kr">
              후속 PR(<a href="https://github.com/apache/arrow-rs/pull/11006" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PR #11006</a>,
              리뷰 중)은 interval 파싱을 완화해 <code>"5 day hour"</code> 같은 bare unit을 PostgreSQL처럼
              <code>"5 day 0 hour"</code>로 해석합니다.
            </p>
